            "title": "December jobs report, earnings, CES 2026: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> previews several of the biggest stories to come next week, including the release of the December jobs report next Friday; earnings results from companies like Constellation Brands (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/STZ\">STZ</a>), Albertsons (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ACI\">ACI</a>), Applied Digital (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APLD\">APLD</a>), and Tilray Brands (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TLRY\">TLRY</a>); and the start of the 2026 Consumer Electronics Show (CES) on Monday with keynotes from Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) CEO Jensen Huang and Advanced Micro Devices (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>) CEO Lisa Su.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
